  PortraitTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: f464fefe809192d4cad6dbf3ca58d5de, type: 3}
  DialogueLine: Arguably one of Canada's most famous performers, Emma Albani was
    an international star, touring Opera houses around the world! In fact, I believe
    the Place-des-Arts metro station in Montreal has a mural dedicated to her. The
    city also has a street named after her! A testament to her star power!
